## The brief

A new online presence was needed for an electrician covering Barry — something that would rank on Google, look the part, and start generating enquiries quickly.

## What we built

A fully managed website under our Managed Starter Website service, covering domestic, commercial, inspection, and emergency electrical call-outs, with dedicated service pages, an areas we serve section, and clear calls to action throughout.

Built on a fast, SEO-ready foundation with domain and hosting included, the site was set up and ready to start ranking within days.

## What's included

- Professional website build — fast turnaround, professional result
- Dedicated pages for all key services
- Areas We Serve section targeting Barry and the Vale of Glamorgan
- Google Business Profile optimisation
- Domain and hosting included in the monthly plan
- Fully managed — all updates handled by NC Digital

## Results

- New site set up and live, targeting local electrician search terms in Barry
- Generates enquiries via quote request forms and direct email/phone CTAs

